+# P5 reference-frame prompts and inspection notes, v2
+
+## Beat 1 — Arrival
+
+```text
+Premium cinematic painted 3D-cartoon illustration, same world and finish as the reference desk; one consistent light setup — warm oil-lamp key light from the desk, cool moonlit rim from a back window; soft volumetric light, gentle bloom on highlights, shallow depth of field, rich smooth gradients with fine film grain and no banding; consistent perspective and scale across frames; restrained, handcrafted, studio-quality game-art polish.
+
+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: approval reference frame for a scroll-driven study app.
+Input image: attached reference desk, style/world reference only.
+Primary request: Arrival. Wide 3:2 landscape shot of an ancient Greek study at night, matching the attached master desk world and finish. A glossy dark wooden desk occupies the lower-right; on it sit exactly a single clay oil lamp, rolled parchment scrolls, reed pen, and closed leather book. The room is lit ONLY by the clay oil lamp: no window light, no moonlight, no bright window, no light shafts, and no extra vessels. The upper-left and upper-centre are dark, quiet, empty negative space with a smooth unobtrusive shadow texture for later HTML title type. No objects or busy texture there. The lamp casts a restrained amber pool across the desk and catches sparse dust drifting through it.
+Composition/framing: 3:2 landscape, title-safe dark negative space across upper-left and upper-centre.
+Text: absolutely no text, letters, numerals, glyphs, markings, logos, watermarks, or writing anywhere.
+Constraints: no people, figures, faces, hands, statues, Clepsydra, UI elements, badges, buttons, emoji, modern objects, neon, purple-cyan palette, glow effects, extra vessels, or any text.
+```
+
+Inspection: No stray text is visible; the upper-left and upper-centre remain dark and largely empty, though the empty desk parchment is visually present below the title area.
+
+## Beat 3 — The day's sheet
+
+```text
+Premium cinematic painted 3D-cartoon illustration, same world and finish as the reference desk; one consistent light setup — warm oil-lamp key light from the desk, cool moonlit rim from a back window; soft volumetric light, gentle bloom on highlights, shallow depth of field, rich smooth gradients with fine film grain and no banding; consistent perspective and scale across frames; restrained, handcrafted, studio-quality game-art polish.
+
+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: approval reference frame for a scroll-driven study app.
+Input image: attached reference desk, style/world reference only.
+Primary request: The day's sheet, 3:2 landscape desk-height view in the same ancient Greek study. A completely BLANK pale parchment sheet lies unrolled across the entire lower half of the composition. No word, ink lines, marks, diagrams, seals, or writing appear on the sheet or anywhere in the image. The upper-left third of the sheet stays clean, evenly lit, smooth, and unobstructed for later HTML heading type. The lamp's warm falloff sits toward the right. The wooden desk, rolled scrolls, reed pen, leather book, and single clay oil lamp remain in their established world but secondary; no bronze bowl or water-clock.
+Composition/framing: 3:2 landscape, sheet dominates lower half, upper-left third of sheet clean and evenly lit.
+Text: absolutely no text, letters, numerals, glyphs, markings, logos, watermarks, or writing anywhere.
+Constraints: no people, figures, faces, hands, statues, Clepsydra, UI elements, badges, buttons, emoji, modern objects, neon, purple-cyan palette, glow effects, or any extra vessels.
+```
+
+Inspection: No stray text or ink marks are visible; the sheet is blank and its upper-left third is clean, but a cool-lit window is prominent in the background.
+
+## Beat 4 — The four subjects as scrolls
+
+```text
+Premium cinematic painted 3D-cartoon illustration, same world and finish as the reference desk; one consistent light setup — warm oil-lamp key light from the desk, cool moonlit rim from a back window; soft volumetric light, gentle bloom on highlights, shallow depth of field, rich smooth gradients with fine film grain and no banding; consistent perspective and scale across frames; restrained, handcrafted, studio-quality game-art polish.
+
+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: approval reference frame for a scroll-driven study app.
+Input image: attached reference desk, style/world reference only.
+Primary request: The four subjects as scrolls. On the glossy wooden desk in the same ancient Greek study, a low wooden Greek scroll rack holds exactly four papyrus scrolls lying horizontally, staggered in depth. The scroll rack is a simple low wood support with no symbols or decorations. Each scroll has a wooden end-knob and one small blank hanging leather tag. The four tags are dyed distinctly: terracotta #b4472f, a clearly green sage #5c7a52 (visibly green, never olive or tan), muted violet #6d4c7d, and deep blue #2e5f8a. Progress is communicated only by how far each scroll unrolls along the desk: four clearly differentiated lengths, approximately 20%, 45%, 70%, and 90% unrolled. Warm lamp rim-light falls on the papyrus edges. A single clay oil lamp can appear as a secondary desk object.
+Composition/framing: 3:2 landscape, all four horizontal scrolls and their differing unrolled lengths readable at a glance.
+Text: absolutely no text, letters, numerals, glyphs, markings, logos, watermarks, or writing anywhere, including tags, scrolls, desk and walls.
+Constraints: no Clepsydra, people, figures, faces, hands, statues, rings, floating objects, glow effects, UI elements, pills, badges, buttons, emoji, modern objects, neon, purple-cyan palette, or extra vessels.
+```
+
+Inspection: No stray text is visible and the four tags read terracotta, green, violet, and blue; however, only one broad unrolled sheet is clearly visible, so four distinct 20/45/70/90% lengths do not read clearly.

